CHAPTER.VERS:
Don't talk anymore so exceedingly proudly; Don't let arrogance come out of your

          {+}
         mouth; For Yahweh is a God of knowledge, And by him actions are weighed.

And he said to them, Why do you

          {+}
         do such things? For I hear of your

          {+}
         evil dealings from all this people.

No, my sons; for the report that I hear is not good: you

          {+}
         make Yahweh's people to transgress.

Why do you

          {+}
         kick at my sacrifice and at my offering, which I have commanded in [my] habitation, and honor your sons above me, to make yourselves fat with the chiefest of all the offerings of Israel my people?
